  "prefLabel": "Bea 602.14 Improvements to real property",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 602.14 “Improvements to real property” means anything that makes the property, or any component thereof, more usable, and valuable.\n\nSource. #14044, eff 8-8-24",
